# Rust / Anchor build output. `cargo check` and `anchor build` generate ~2GB of
# artifacts per program; these must never be committed.
target/
**/target/

# Anchor build output + generated IDLs/types (regenerated by `anchor build`)
.anchor/
test-ledger/

# Keypairs — NEVER commit these. A program keypair is a deploy authority and a
# leaked one lets anyone upgrade the deployed program.
*.json.key
**/deploy/*-keypair.json
id.json
